# L §2.1: "A quarter, which ISO 8601 doesn't write, is 2026-Q1 to 2026-Q4 ... (calendar quarters, from January)";
# L §2.4 prints "a quarter as 2026-Q1 (§2.1)". 2026-05-14 falls in April-June, 2026-Q2. (Writer 6; writer 8: the
# built-in index quarters is gone, L §2.2 lists the built-in indexes days months years bank_account, so a binding
# over quarters names no index: LOAD-NAME.)
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"

ask q1: quarter_of(2026-05-14)
=== expect
q1: 2026-Q2
  cut 2026-12-31
